WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.376
SUPERCELL

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:04.505
Begin the 13 cannon salute.

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:15.974
Today is a very big day.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:18.560
A celebration for Troops, Villagers,

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:21.313
and whoever else doesn't fall
into these two categories.

00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:25.317
Happy 13th Clashiversary.

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:28.070
Thirteen!

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:47.548
Why is everything going so wrong?

00:00:49.091 --> 00:00:51.677
My staff, which gives me
my powerful powers,

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.348
tells me that the number thirteen
is a dark omen for this celebration.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:59.726
I don't care why.
Just make it stop.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:04.273
Unlucky thirteen explains why
the goblins' digging led to that sinkhole.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:09.736
I'm cool, except for the dirt
in my mouth and of course, the ants.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:14.658
And it's also why the miners' digging
has gotten perilously close to the ocean.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.493
Say what?

00:01:19.371 --> 00:01:21.832
This has been hard day for me.

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:25.252
Wait, my life gem has turned
from ominous to calm.

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:29.089
All is now right with the Village.
We even have a sinkhole pool.

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:33.677
So it's okay to celebrate?

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.555
Yes, my powerful powers
grant me the power

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:40.726
to declare thirteen as a number
to be celebrated, powerfully.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:48.400
HERE'S YOUR PROBLEM.
IT WASN'T SCREWED IN!

00:01:53.697 --> 00:01:55.032
OOPSIE.

00:01:57.701 --> 00:02:01.997
HAPPY 13th CLASHIVERSARY,
CLASH OF CLANS!

